{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-skills-manager-plus#card-zh","repo":"appthin/dsh-skills-manager-plus","commit":"3906f2f862a72a396d50777918a1f250ad1238fc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skills-manager-plus 是面向 DSH 网页端的技能与命令管理插件。它在设置侧栏注册管理页面，并由主机端 API 读取和维护 DSH 技能文件及保存的提示词命令。用户可以浏览、创建、编辑、启停和删除技能，安装技能归档，也可以管理斜杠命令与 .agents 技能目录开关；已保存命令会出现在输入框的命令菜单中。适合希望直接从浏览器设置管理技能和复用提示词的 DSH 用户。插件通过 DSH 本机 web 服务工作，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-7","lib/client.js:2248-2262","lib/index.js:623-690","lib/commands.js:174-229"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-skills-manager-plus#card-en","repo":"appthin/dsh-skills-manager-plus","commit":"3906f2f862a72a396d50777918a1f250ad1238fc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skills-manager-plus adds a DSH web settings page for managing skills and saved slash commands. Users can edit, enable, disable, or delete skills, install archives, and save reusable prompts for the composer menu. It also manages .agents skill roots and requires no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-7","lib/client.js:2248-2262","lib/index.js:623-690","lib/commands.js:174-229"]}
