{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-skills-manager-plus#feature-1","repo":"appthin/dsh-skills-manager-plus","commit":"3906f2f862a72a396d50777918a1f250ad1238fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skills-manager-plus 的功能「技能维护」：在设置页查看、创建、编辑、启停和删除技能文件。用户可修改技能内容及调用开关，主机 API 将操作路由到技能存储逻辑。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:635-654","lib/skills.js:10-18"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-skills-manager-plus#feature-2","repo":"appthin/dsh-skills-manager-plus","commit":"3906f2f862a72a396d50777918a1f250ad1238fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skills-manager-plus 的功能「归档安装」：从网页选择 zip、tar 或 tar.gz 技能包并提交安装，可选择用户或项目作用域；服务端把归档交给安装逻辑并返回安装结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:654-667"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-skills-manager-plus#feature-3","repo":"appthin/dsh-skills-manager-plus","commit":"3906f2f862a72a396d50777918a1f250ad1238fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skills-manager-plus 的功能「保存提示词为命令」：在命令管理页保存命令名称、说明和提示词正文；命令注册到 DSH 命令菜单，调用时将正文及用户附加输入作为用户消息提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/commands.js:174-195","lib/commands.js:222-229"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-skills-manager-plus#feature-4","repo":"appthin/dsh-skills-manager-plus","commit":"3906f2f862a72a396d50777918a1f250ad1238fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skills-manager-plus 的功能「.agents 目录开关」：从设置页批量启用或停用用户级及项目级 .agents 技能根目录；状态保存管理器实际停用的项目，以便切回时恢复这些技能。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:308-355","lib/index.js:685-688"]}
